{"id": "34340", "title": "出租情人", "author": "宝贝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 36, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34340.htm", "intro": "居然有人长得和她死去的丈夫如此相像！她和丈夫曾经是那么相爱，怎知他后来却流连花丛，把她一个人丢在家，不顾她的死活！她心里有好多恨、好多怨，直到现在仍无法忘怀。好！既然那人的工作就叫“服务到府”，那她就把他订下来当帮佣，要把对丈夫的怒意全部发泄在他身上！只是，他温柔体贴、善解人意，和她丈夫完全不同，而且一看到他的笑容，她就会不自觉的想到和丈夫新婚时甜蜜的时光，忍不住替他理理领带、拿拖鞋……不！她不是要这样的，她要对他发脾气，她要把丈夫对自己的折磨加诸在他身上！可，她的心好像渐渐管不住了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34340", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2182190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2182191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2182192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2182193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2182194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2182195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2182196.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2182197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2182198.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2182199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2182200.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2182201.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2182202.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2182203.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2182204.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2182205.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2182206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2182207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2182208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2182209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2182210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2182211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2182212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2182213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2